{"siren:A volunteer needs to swap Saturday morning for Sunday afternoon. The organiser can allow the change if another volunteer covers Saturday. The Sunday team already has enough drivers but needs someone to welcome visitors.":"7f8a20b713450a20fb6c91be2b8a7dd1530fa712f38ac00b2921f417e6a47c27","siren:The lift will be out of service on Thursday morning. Deliveries can be left with reception. Residents needing help should call before Wednesday evening.":"002524585e83fb5125cb62e430fa05033984c24dcbbab26681018e8cf25e04de"}